OL,3,GNEWSAPriest taken to hospital before
OL,4,AWiddecombe service
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe priest who had been expected to
OL,7,Flead a memorial service for Ann
OL,8,FWiddecombe at Westminster Cathedral has
OL,9,Fbeen taken to hospital.
OL,11,FArchbishop of Westminster Richard Moth
OL,12,F"felt unwell" and is undergoing tests,
OL,13,FWestminster Diocese said.
OL,15,FBishop James Curry will instead lead
OL,16,Fthe service later, which will be
OL,17,Fattended by politicians past and
OL,18,Fpresent, including Reform UK's Nigel
OL,19,FFarage and Richard Tice.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
