OL,3,GNEWSAPriest taken to hospital before
OL,4,AWiddecombe service
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 78-year-old former MP was found
OL,7,Fdead on 9 July at her home in Haytor,
OL,8,Fon Dartmoor in Devon and Joshua Kerry,
OL,9,F28, from Rotherham in South Yorkshire,
OL,10,Fhas been charged with her murder.
